{{include:_Disclaimer.partial.md}}

## Parties

- Network / Venture: {{network_name}} / {{venture_name}}
- Custodian entity: {{custodian_entity}}
- Jurisdiction: {{jurisdiction}}

## Mandate

Custodian holds/trusts assets for the commons layer: property care, liability interface, transaction facilitation, and referee functions as defined by network governance. Custodian does **not** become residual owner-extractor of the commons.

## Asset classes

{{asset_classes}}

## Scope

{{mandate_scope}}

## Transparency

Custody records remain visible to affiliates per network transparency norms.

## Termination / succession

Define succession without asset capture. Human gate: lawyer-in-jurisdiction + OVN custodian experience.

